{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fa0ddc6a-4c6c-821e-8070-1e5130d8d59d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T12:01:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:31-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yes, good morning. I'm calling for my mother, she lives at 380 Bliss Road, over by Easton's Beach. The plow, it did the street but it left the end of her driveway blocked, a big wall of snow, heavy, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 380 Bliss Road. And this is from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the one that was snow and then rain, Sunday into Monday. Now it's Tuesday and the wall is still there. It got wet and now is like cement. She cannot get the car out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that stuff gets heavy once the rain hits it. Let me write this down. Driveway apron blocked by plow bank, 380 Bliss. And you're her daughter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm Beverly Burdick. I'm her daughter. I don't live there, I come over after work, but I'm trying to fix it from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Beverly. Is your mom okay for now? Any appointment she has to get to, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she's fine, she's inside, warm. It's just annoying. I want a plow to come back and clear the end, please. They did half the job."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can put in a request for the crew to come back through that block. Usually the plow bank at the end of a driveway is the homeowner's to shovel, but if it's real packed in, we'll note it so they can take another pass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Packed, yes, very packed. Like ice. I cannot ask my mother to shovel that, she's not young. So you put it in the list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's going on the list right now. Bliss Road, number 380, plow returns to clear driveway end. Anything else on that street, like the whole road not done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the road is okay. Just the end of the driveway. Oh, and another thing. The parking ban, the snow ban. When it lifts? Because her neighbor's car is still parked outside and I don't know if I can park there when I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, so the ban was called for the storm, and it's lifted once the crews finish the streets and it gets announced. Looks like it's been lifted as of this morning, but I'd double check the city's announcement page or the recorded line to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I can park on the street now? Today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm seeing, yes. If you park near where the plow bank is, just leave room so the crew can get in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I will park a little far. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Now, for the work order, can I get a number in case somebody needs to reach you or your mom?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can use mine. It's 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Got it. And that's Beverly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Beverly Burdick. B-U-R-D-I-C-K."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Burdick. Okay, I've got you all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long it takes? Like today, tomorrow? Because every time is the same, they push it and leave it, and then we wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:39-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say probably within a day or two. The crews have a lot of these after a storm like that, and the rain made everything worse. If it's not cleared by Thursday, call back and mention the request, and we can bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Okay. I write it down. You know, I was going to go out today to the used bookstore, they gave me store credit for a box of paperbacks, and now I am here on the phone about snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, well, at least the credit isn't going anywhere. Hopefully you can get over there this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe. After I see my mother. So, to confirm, plow comes back, ban is lifted, and I call Thursday if not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Plow comes back to 380 Bliss, ban's lifted, and Thursday you check in if it's still blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I hope they really come this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make sure the note's clear. Take care, Beverly. Tell your mom hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye bye."
    }
  ],
